== (a) Prop 3.1/Cor 3.2: a_max(d')/d' with a_max=8h/625-d'+X-rho ==
  n=256: max a_max/d' over r<=64,Q<=2^14,S<=2^12, all 7 d' = 0.700886 (exact 588535/839702); violations: 0
  n=512: min a_max/d' = 2.2806  (>1 means constant-T (K) not excluded by Prop 3.1)
  coefficient 2048/625+1/(2r) < 4 for r>=4: True; at r=4: 3.4018E vs 4E-4 (E>=2^15)
  for comparison 2a_max/d' at r=4,Q=128,S=64,n=256,d'=2E-2: 1.4000 (>=1, so R18-T Prop 4.2 does not apply)

