== (d) Lemma 2.1(iii): projective invariance of E-sparsity level ==
  E=8, a=8: xi=t*w^7 has level 1; after the swap t<->w it is [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0] -> level 7; Lemma 2.1(iii) predicts <= 1 + (a mod E) = 1
  random: 72/200 general Mobius changes violate s->s+(a mod E); affine changes violating s->s: 0/200

